@baseurl  = https://elevate-horizon-connect-api.onrender.com

### health check
GET {{baseurl}}/api/health

### get all events
GET {{baseurl}}/api/events 

### get single event
GET {{baseurl}}/api/events/2 


### get single event today
GET {{baseurl}}/api/events/today


### get single event date
GET {{baseurl}}/api/events/today?date=2026-11-12


### get single event by category
GET {{baseurl}}/api/events?category=Music


### get single event by spotsRemaining
GET {{baseurl}}/api/events?spotsRemaining=50


### Registration for an event
POST {{baseurl}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: student_secret_render_888

{
    "eventId": 1,
    "fullName": "Test Person 2",
    "email": "test.person2@example.com"
}


### List of registered People
GET {{baseurl}}/api/registrations/event/1

